{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的唯一救主"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，以色列啊，創造你、使你成形的耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「不要害怕，因為我已經救贖了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我點名呼召了你，你屬於我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你穿越洪濤，我必與你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你渡過江河，必不會被水淹沒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在火中走過，必不會被燒傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火焰不會燒到你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是你的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的聖者，是你的救主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用埃及作你的贖價，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使古實和西巴代替你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我珍視你，看重你，深愛你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我用他人代替你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用列邦交換你的生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要害怕，因為我與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必從東方帶來你的子孫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從西方召集你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要對北方說，『交出來！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對南方說，『不要扣留！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要從遠方把我的兒子們帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從地極把我的女兒們領回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有屬於我的人都要回來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為自己的榮耀創造了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他們成形並塑造了他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「要把那些有眼看不見、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳聽不見的人帶出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓萬國聚集，列邦會合。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們哪個神明曾啟示這事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰預先向我們顯明要發生的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們可以找證人來證實，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫聽見的人都說這是真的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『以色列人啊，你們是我的證人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我揀選的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要叫你們認識我，相信我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白我是耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以前沒有上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以後也沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我，唯獨我是耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外沒有別的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾啟示，我曾拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們中間沒有別的神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，你們是我的證人。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我從太初就是上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能逃脫我的手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能逆轉我所做的呢？』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你們的救贖主耶和華——以色列的聖者說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「為了你們的緣故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必派大軍進攻巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使迦勒底人坐著他們引以為榮的船逃亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是你們的聖者耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的創造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你們的君王。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華曾在大海中開道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大水中闢路徑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使埃及的戰車、馬匹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"軍兵和勇士傾巢而出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們一同倒下，不再起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像熄滅的燈火一樣滅沒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「不要想念過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要緬懷往事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要行一件新事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這事現在就要發生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你們沒有察覺嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在曠野闢道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠開江河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野獸必尊崇我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中有豺狼和鴕鳥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我使曠野有甘泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠有江河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供我揀選的子民飲用。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是我為自己所造的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要頌揚我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"「雅各啊，你卻沒有求告我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你竟然厭煩我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你沒有帶來作燔祭的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有用祭物來尊崇我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有讓你因祭物而受累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有讓你因香料而煩擾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你並沒有花錢買菖蒲獻給我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有用祭物的脂肪滿足我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"反而使我因你的罪惡而受累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的過犯而煩擾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「我，唯獨我為自己的緣故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去你的過犯，忘掉你的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你儘管提醒我，你我可以理論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以提出理由證明自己的清白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的始祖犯了罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的首領也背叛了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要羞辱你聖殿的官長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各遭毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列受辱罵。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":28}